# Task 4.151, slice 2: the live player's fire runs the ASM's own frame
# (PlayerFireReal -> FUNC_001040 -> FUNC_000931, ffe.asm:77011 -> 69727), on the live path with
# no test-only hook. Asserts the bolt spawn's own observable (+0x151 bit 1), and names the
# FUNC_000931 precondition when the chain stops short.
